WEBVTT

00:02.770 --> 00:05.400
Kuma Kuma Calisthenics, begin!

00:14.120 --> 00:17.160
First, get into the rhythm!

00:19.450 --> 00:22.340
Raise both hands and 
make an intimidating pose.

00:23.540 --> 00:26.090
Rawr! Rawr!

00:26.090 --> 00:30.210
Lower your hips and make 
the salmon scooping pose.

00:31.070 --> 00:34.010
Rawr! Rawr!

00:34.010 --> 00:38.600
Found a beehive. Rawr! Rawr!

00:38.600 --> 00:41.220
Stung by bees. Ouch, ouch, ouch...

00:41.220 --> 00:44.040
What are you doing, Yuna Sis?

00:44.600 --> 00:46.610
Morning, Fina.

00:46.610 --> 00:50.250
Well, we've been eating 
a lot of shortcake lately,

00:50.250 --> 00:53.410
so I thought I should get more exercise...

00:55.020 --> 00:58.050
What are you doing here so early, Fina?

00:58.050 --> 00:59.530
I almost forgot.

01:00.250 --> 01:05.000
Um, did you get a letter, too?

01:05.000 --> 01:06.350
A letter?

01:07.390 --> 01:08.830
Hold on a sec.

01:11.980 --> 01:13.260
Oh, I really got something.

01:15.460 --> 01:17.930
Misa-na Farrengram?

01:18.700 --> 01:21.100
Misa-na... Oh!

01:21.100 --> 01:26.230
Please call me Misa, Bear Lady! 
No, Sister Yuna!

01:26.230 --> 01:28.060
A letter from Misa, huh?

01:28.060 --> 01:31.400
I haven't seen her since our 
first visit to the royal capital.

01:31.400 --> 01:32.820
What's the letter about?

01:32.820 --> 01:34.530
It's an invitation.

01:36.260 --> 01:41.130
It's an invitation to 
L-Lady Misa's birthday party!

01:41.130 --> 01:45.250
We've been invited to a noble's 
birthday party. What should we do?!

01:45.250 --> 01:47.410
Even if you ask me...

01:49.740 --> 01:50.950
What should we do?

03:23.580 --> 03:25.800
<i>It has been a long time, Sister Yuna.</i>

03:26.300 --> 03:30.270
<i>I am still very thankful you 
saved me from those monsters.</i>

03:30.580 --> 03:33.180
<i>If you didn't save me,</i>

03:33.180 --> 03:39.370
<i>I would have never reunited with 
Sister Noa or become friends with Fina.</i>

03:39.990 --> 03:42.340
<i>My dear benefactor, Sister Yuna.</i>

03:42.340 --> 03:46.260
<i>I will soon be having 
my tenth birthday party.</i>

03:46.260 --> 03:50.360
<i>It would make me very happy 
if you and Fina are able to attend.</i>

03:50.360 --> 03:52.160
Birthday party, huh?

03:53.260 --> 03:55.580
Why did Lady Misa invite me?!

03:55.580 --> 03:59.340
Well, you're closer to Misa than I am, Fina.

03:59.340 --> 04:03.970
But, but... what do we do at 
a noble's birthday party?

04:09.610 --> 04:13.110
I'm sure it's not as grand 
as the king's birthday party,

04:13.110 --> 04:16.060
but it sounds like a pai—
er, sounds like trouble!

04:16.060 --> 04:18.480
My stomach is starting to hurt again...

04:19.540 --> 04:22.650
What'll happen if we decline the invitation?

04:22.650 --> 04:26.710
No idea. I don't really understand nobles.

04:29.130 --> 04:32.070
We should ask nobles about nobles!

04:33.910 --> 04:39.840
<b>Bear, Knowing of Nobles</b>

04:33.910 --> 04:39.840
<b>Bear, Knowing of Nobles</b>

04:34.190 --> 04:38.170
Oh, we received an invitation as well.

04:38.170 --> 04:42.380
Also, Grandfather Gran 
asked me to take you with us.

04:43.370 --> 04:44.430
Gran...

04:45.810 --> 04:48.400
Misa's grandpa, right?

04:48.400 --> 04:52.380
Yes. The head of the 
Farrengram family, Lord Gran,

04:52.380 --> 04:55.500
will be celebrating his fiftieth 
birthday at the same time.

04:55.500 --> 04:56.900
Can we decline this invitation?

04:56.900 --> 04:58.400
You plan to decline?

04:56.900 --> 04:58.400
You're declining?!

04:58.400 --> 05:03.690
Huh? Will we get executed for declining 
a noble's invitation or something?

05:03.690 --> 05:07.740
No, no. What kind of people 
do you think nobles are?

05:07.740 --> 05:11.420
Well, we don't know anything about nobles.

05:11.420 --> 05:14.230
We can't attend 
a birthday party so casually.

05:14.230 --> 05:17.130
Although I would love to see Lady Misa...

05:17.130 --> 05:23.610
It could become troublesome for so many 
people if I offended any of the nobility.

05:24.630 --> 05:26.220
We might cause trouble 
for Misa and her family.

05:26.220 --> 05:29.870
Maybe even Noa, Miss Tiermina, 
and many others, right?

05:29.870 --> 05:30.930
Yeah.

05:31.310 --> 05:32.670
I see.

05:32.670 --> 05:34.730
Then, there's nothing to worry about.

05:34.730 --> 05:37.780
The two of you will only be 
attending Misa-na's birthday party.

05:37.780 --> 05:40.420
Only her close friends 
and family will attend.

05:40.420 --> 05:42.470
Noa and I will be there, too.

05:42.470 --> 05:45.280
We'd be able to handle any 
problems that may arise.

05:45.280 --> 05:49.530
So, please come with us! Misa wishes
 to see the two of you as well!

05:49.530 --> 05:50.770
But...

05:50.770 --> 05:52.770
Don't you wish to see Misa as well?

05:53.970 --> 05:56.840
Misa will be so sad if you don't attend.

05:56.840 --> 05:59.000
She may even cry!

06:00.900 --> 06:02.850
How would you feel if you were in her shoes?

06:02.850 --> 06:07.830
I would be so sad if I had invited 
you and you didn't attend...

06:10.180 --> 06:12.370
I understand. I'll go!

06:12.370 --> 06:13.470
Yes!

06:13.990 --> 06:17.790
Miss Yuna will definitely go 
since Fina is attending, right?

06:19.070 --> 06:20.810
Yeah, I'll go.

06:20.810 --> 06:24.590
Great! We shall all go 
on another trip together!

06:24.590 --> 06:26.420
There isn't much time!

06:26.420 --> 06:29.030
We have to decide on the dress 
Fina will wear for the party!

06:29.030 --> 06:29.980
Huh?

06:29.980 --> 06:31.200
Do not worry, Fina!

06:31.200 --> 06:34.840
I'll do a much better job picking out a dress
 for you than my mother or my sister could!

06:35.500 --> 06:37.020
Yuna Sis!

06:39.420 --> 06:40.750
Yuna Sis?!

06:40.750 --> 06:42.750
I'll have you try on various dresses, Fina!

06:42.750 --> 06:44.690
This again?!

06:44.690 --> 06:48.910
Is there something I need to prepare 
for a noble's birthday party?

06:48.910 --> 06:51.200
We'll take care of that.

06:51.200 --> 06:55.560
All you need to do is prepare 
a birthday present for Misa-na.

06:56.280 --> 07:01.520
You make it sound simple, but what 
kind of gifts does a noble girl like?

07:03.170 --> 07:07.080
Why don't you give her something 
with a bear motif from your store?

07:07.080 --> 07:09.490
I know my daughter would 
love something like that.

07:09.810 --> 07:11.700
I could see that.

07:12.370 --> 07:14.340
Bears, huh?

07:14.340 --> 07:18.230
A bear-themed gift a girl
 would love to receive...

07:19.380 --> 07:23.130
<i>Perfect. I was thinking of making 
one for Princess Flora anyways.</i>

07:23.580 --> 07:27.010
Thanks. I've thought of a good present.

07:28.490 --> 07:29.800
Hello.

07:30.590 --> 07:32.440
Sorry for the sudden visit, Sherry.

07:32.440 --> 07:33.230
Not at all.

07:33.230 --> 07:37.010
It's fine since there aren't any customers 
to attend to right now, Yuna Sis.

07:37.590 --> 07:40.710
Have things been going well 
with Mrs. Nahru and Mr. Temocca?

07:40.710 --> 07:41.450
Yeah!

07:41.450 --> 07:47.270
They teach me very patiently, make me 
delicious sweets, and treat me really well!

07:47.680 --> 07:49.690
What brings you here today?

07:49.690 --> 07:51.360
Well, actually...

07:54.070 --> 07:56.140
What are these, Yuna Sis?!

07:56.140 --> 07:58.660
Are these really Kumayuru and Kumakyu?!

07:58.660 --> 08:01.270
They're so small! They're so cute!

08:01.270 --> 08:04.050
I was wondering if you could make me 
a stuffed animal this small.

08:04.050 --> 08:05.190
Think you can do it?

08:05.190 --> 08:07.590
Y-Yeah, I think I can.

08:07.590 --> 08:10.390
Um, is it okay to take their measurements?

08:11.780 --> 08:13.300
Okay, don't move.

08:19.400 --> 08:21.260
How long do you think it'll take?

08:21.260 --> 08:22.520
It might be asking for the impossible,

08:22.520 --> 08:25.200
but do you think you could 
get it done in five days?

08:25.200 --> 08:27.150
Of course, I'll pay a fitting amount for it.

08:27.150 --> 08:31.700
It's doable. I'll make it as long 
as I adjust my work schedule.

08:31.700 --> 08:33.110
Isn't this your first job?

08:33.110 --> 08:35.570
Don't worry about the shop.

08:35.570 --> 08:37.860
Mr. Temocca, Mrs. Nahru...

08:37.860 --> 08:41.040
We'll help if you run into any trouble.

08:41.040 --> 08:43.400
Huh? Oh, um...

08:44.040 --> 08:45.710
Thank you very much.

08:45.710 --> 08:48.750
But I'd like to do both things properly.

08:48.750 --> 08:50.090
Sherry...

08:50.090 --> 08:55.620
The work you hired me for and 
the work that Yuna Sis gives me

08:55.620 --> 08:57.680
are both important to me.

08:58.020 --> 09:01.030
Looks like we can't convince you otherwise.

09:01.030 --> 09:03.550
Just make sure you don't overexert yourself.

09:03.550 --> 09:06.400
You better ask for help 
when you really need it.

09:06.830 --> 09:09.240
Yes. Thank you very much!

09:09.240 --> 09:14.810
<i>The director of the orphanage said 
that the couple might adopt Sherry...</i>

09:14.810 --> 09:17.160
<i>But it looks like they're already a family.</i>

09:19.180 --> 09:24.280
Actually, I'd like to order 
a few sets of the stuffed bears.

09:24.280 --> 09:27.370
I think the kids at the orphanage 
would really love them, too.

09:27.370 --> 09:30.650
That's true. All the little 
kids would want one.

09:30.650 --> 09:32.200
But I can't make that many so quickly...

09:32.200 --> 09:33.510
I'm not in a rush for the other sets.

09:33.510 --> 09:38.090
I'd like the three of you to 
take your time and make them.

09:39.140 --> 09:40.080
Yes!

09:42.740 --> 09:47.950
Welp, I got Misa's present figured out 
and saw a heartwarming scene.

09:47.950 --> 09:50.330
Today's a good day.

09:55.040 --> 09:56.660
I-I'm home?

09:58.070 --> 10:00.520
I can't believe you left me 
behind and went home!

10:01.490 --> 10:02.930
Sorry! Sorry!

10:02.930 --> 10:05.840
I thought it'd take you a while 
to choose a dress.

10:05.840 --> 10:08.290
Aren't you going to wear a dress, Yuna Sis?

10:08.290 --> 10:11.070
It wouldn't look good on me.

10:11.070 --> 10:14.620
I'll just look forward to seeing your dress.

10:14.620 --> 10:17.230
Did Noa choose a good dress for you?

10:17.230 --> 10:20.230
Yeah, it's a very beautiful dress!

10:20.230 --> 10:22.990
I'm sure Lady Misa will be satisfied with it.

10:22.990 --> 10:26.300
R-Really? That's good to hear.

10:26.300 --> 10:30.290
Oh, I've decided on what 
to give Misa as a present.

10:30.800 --> 10:32.900
I'm giving her Kumayuru and 
Kumakyu stuffed animals.

10:32.900 --> 10:35.640
Stuffed Kumayuru and Kumakyu?

10:36.310 --> 10:38.440
I'm sure she'll love them!

10:40.490 --> 10:42.700
What should I get her?

10:42.700 --> 10:45.450
I can't afford anything 
Lady Misa would like.

10:45.450 --> 10:47.910
How about preparing something with me?

10:48.270 --> 10:52.000
But the stuffed bears are 
something you prepared, Yuna Sis.

10:52.000 --> 10:53.850
Something else.

10:53.850 --> 10:57.590
All birthdays should have 
<i>that</i> sweet and delicious thing.

10:58.020 --> 11:00.210
Sweet and delicious?

11:00.930 --> 11:06.120
Let's make one together. 
We'll make a huge shortcake for her.

11:06.120 --> 11:08.480
A huge shortcake...

11:08.800 --> 11:10.440
Well? What do you think?

11:10.830 --> 11:12.740
Yeah! Let's make one!

11:38.390 --> 11:41.480
Please take care of Fina, Yuna.

11:41.480 --> 11:47.470
Leave it to me. I'll take on any 
nobles who try to pick a fight!

11:47.470 --> 11:50.150
Try your best <i>not</i> to do that.

11:52.220 --> 11:53.780
What's wrong, Shuri?

11:54.210 --> 11:56.450
It's not fair...

11:56.980 --> 12:02.420
<i>Come to think of it, I haven't taken 
Shuri anywhere since we visited Mileela.</i>

12:02.420 --> 12:05.960
<i>Looks like I'll have to add another 
set of stuffed bears to that order.</i>

12:08.590 --> 12:10.300
Listen, Shuri.

12:10.300 --> 12:12.120
S-Sis?

12:12.440 --> 12:15.340
Going out is fun,

12:15.340 --> 12:21.090
but it can also sweep you up 
into really difficult situations.

12:21.490 --> 12:24.400
Your smile is scaring me, Sis.

12:25.060 --> 12:27.080
Be good and stay home.

12:27.080 --> 12:27.970
Don't worry.

12:28.320 --> 12:34.440
Once you're a little older, you'll be 
able to handle all sorts of stomach aches!

12:39.930 --> 12:42.460
Kumayuru! Kumakyu!

12:44.040 --> 12:46.170
So cute! I love them so much!

12:46.170 --> 12:48.020
We're really not going by carriage?

12:46.440 --> 12:49.240
So fluffy! So warm! I love them!

12:48.020 --> 12:51.700
Noa really wanted to ride the bears.

12:49.240 --> 12:52.080
They feel so nice! I love them!

12:51.700 --> 12:55.710
Well, it's faster without a carriage 
so I'm fine with that.

12:56.390 --> 12:59.270
And you're only taking two guards with you?

12:59.270 --> 13:01.550
Oh, these two are Rabon and Gouges.

13:02.660 --> 13:05.130
We look forward to working 
with you, Lady Yuna.

13:05.650 --> 13:08.890
I didn't think we'd need any guards 
since you're traveling with us,

13:08.890 --> 13:10.810
but I was told I had to take some.

13:10.810 --> 13:13.430
Well, you <i>are</i> the lord of Crimonia.

13:13.430 --> 13:15.170
Sorry I don't seem like one.

13:15.170 --> 13:17.060
Miss Yuna!

13:17.530 --> 13:21.820
We'll be riding them like we did before. 
We'll switch during the second half.

13:21.820 --> 13:23.330
I understand!

13:23.670 --> 13:27.480
Now, let's depart towards Misa's home!

13:32.670 --> 13:35.290
Looks like a great harvest, Granny.

13:35.290 --> 13:38.780
Looks like it, Grampa.

13:41.270 --> 13:42.710
This is the best!

13:42.710 --> 13:45.540
Kumakyu! Go faster! Faster!

13:47.190 --> 13:49.820
Noa and Kumakyu are so excited.

13:49.820 --> 13:52.010
Kumayuru, go!

13:53.640 --> 13:55.640
Kumakyu! Top speed!

13:55.640 --> 13:58.860
This isn't a race!

13:58.860 --> 14:01.690
Some bears just ran by, Granny.

14:02.060 --> 14:05.650
They sure did, Grampa.

14:04.260 --> 14:05.650
Wait! Wait! Wait!

14:05.650 --> 14:07.620
Slow down a bit!

14:08.610 --> 14:11.340
Some horses ran by, too, Granny.

14:11.340 --> 14:14.700
They sure did, Grampa.

14:17.620 --> 14:20.130
The bears are faster?!

14:21.450 --> 14:24.010
Okay, everyone stand back.

14:24.010 --> 14:26.090
Travel Version Bear House!

14:27.990 --> 14:31.140
Okay, I've set up a place to sleep tonight.

14:31.140 --> 14:33.810
I heard about this from Noa, but...

14:33.810 --> 14:37.250
You always find a way to break 
the rules of common sense.

14:38.140 --> 14:40.480
I wouldn't mind camping outside.

14:40.480 --> 14:42.860
Huh? It's dangerous to sleep outside.

14:43.350 --> 14:48.350
But if we sleep outside, we could 
sleep with Kumakyu and Kumayuru.

14:49.760 --> 14:55.350
No worries. Kumayuru and Kumakyu 
can shrink and fit in the Bear House.

14:55.350 --> 14:56.870
You'll be able to sleep with them.

14:56.870 --> 14:58.620
Is that true?

14:59.780 --> 15:01.860
That's great, Lady Noa.

15:01.860 --> 15:05.380
This time, we'll be able to 
hug them as we sleep.

15:05.930 --> 15:08.430
That sounds splendid, Fina!

15:09.790 --> 15:12.320
I'm sure everyone is tired.

15:13.230 --> 15:15.290
Come on in and rest.

15:15.290 --> 15:18.110
We will stand guard outside.

15:18.110 --> 15:18.770
Yes.

15:18.770 --> 15:21.110
It's more comfortable inside.

15:21.110 --> 15:25.690
Kumayuru and Kumakyu can detect 
monsters and bandits if they come nearby.

15:25.690 --> 15:27.530
There's no need to stand guard.

15:27.860 --> 15:30.460
That's even more of a reason for us.

15:30.460 --> 15:34.320
We want to be with our beloved and 
hardworking horses until morning.

15:37.340 --> 15:41.700
Yeah, we made Kumayuru and 
Kumakyu run too fast. Sorry.

15:41.700 --> 15:44.170
I also apologize for getting too excited.

15:46.840 --> 15:49.340
At the very least, 
please eat something warm.

15:49.340 --> 15:51.880
Wow! It looks delicious!

15:51.880 --> 15:53.680
Thank you very much, Lady Yuna!

16:00.030 --> 16:01.890
All finished.

16:01.890 --> 16:04.440
Okay, let's eat.

16:05.510 --> 16:08.960
Freshly baked fluffy and 
chewy bread. Irresistible!

16:08.960 --> 16:11.610
This grilled fish is superb.

16:11.610 --> 16:14.540
I can't believe we can eat 
something like this while traveling.

16:14.540 --> 16:18.920
This soup is full of fish and shellfish,
 and it's so delicious.

16:18.920 --> 16:23.430
We still have a lot of Miss 
Anz's special seafood soup.

16:23.430 --> 16:24.860
Anyone want seconds?

16:24.860 --> 16:26.250
Yes!

16:29.100 --> 16:32.990
I'm so full it's making me sleepy.

16:32.990 --> 16:34.290
Me, too.

16:34.290 --> 16:37.430
Girls, you need to take 
a bath before sleeping.

16:37.430 --> 16:38.810
Okay...

16:38.810 --> 16:40.190
There's a bath?

16:40.190 --> 16:41.410
Of course there is.

16:41.410 --> 16:42.810
Father...

16:43.170 --> 16:45.410
Houses are supposed to have baths.

16:45.410 --> 16:51.310
That's true, but this is a forest 
in the middle of nowhere.

16:51.310 --> 16:53.730
Here, we have warm food 
and relaxing baths...

16:51.780 --> 16:54.180
Are you going to take a bath, too, Yuna Sis?

16:54.180 --> 16:55.170
That's right!

16:55.170 --> 16:56.760
Let's take it together!

16:56.760 --> 16:58.940
I'll join once I finish cleaning up.

16:58.940 --> 17:00.760
You two should go on ahead.

17:00.760 --> 17:02.160
Understood!

17:02.160 --> 17:05.530
Okay, Fina. We must prepare for Miss Yuna.

17:05.530 --> 17:07.500
Huh? What is there to prepare?

17:07.910 --> 17:10.000
You're last, Cliff.

17:10.000 --> 17:12.170
Huh? I'm taking one, too?

17:12.170 --> 17:14.860
We're going to arrive in the city 
of Sheelin tomorrow, right?

17:14.860 --> 17:17.680
Shouldn't a city lord 
present themselves properly?

17:18.220 --> 17:20.760
You sound like a normal person sometimes.

17:21.150 --> 17:22.780
How rude.

17:22.780 --> 17:26.010
It's a little late to ask this, 
but what kind of city is Sheelin?

17:26.010 --> 17:28.490
You're really late asking.

17:28.490 --> 17:32.070
It's not much different from Crimonia.

17:34.100 --> 17:38.230
By the way, do nobles have the time to 
attend things like birthday parties so easily,

17:38.230 --> 17:41.370
no matter how close they are?

17:41.370 --> 17:45.000
Connections are especially 
important to nobles.

17:45.480 --> 17:48.320
Oh, I totally thought...

17:49.270 --> 17:53.380
that Sheelin would have some 
kind of delicious specialty.

17:53.380 --> 17:54.380
Hey, what's wrong with you?

17:57.110 --> 17:59.330
Miss Yuna! How much longer?!

17:59.330 --> 18:01.640
Yeah, yeah. Hold on.

18:02.280 --> 18:05.180
Well, it's pretty hard being a city lord.

18:05.180 --> 18:08.630
All you need to worry about 
is enjoying the birthday party.

18:08.630 --> 18:09.440
Huh?

18:09.440 --> 18:11.650
Uh, okay?

18:23.590 --> 18:25.710
Yeah, I know.

18:30.630 --> 18:32.590
D-Don't get any closer, you monsters!

18:39.050 --> 18:40.590
Way too slow!

18:42.340 --> 18:44.430
Looks like I made it.

18:49.750 --> 18:52.110
<i>This is way too much of a coincidence.</i>

18:53.820 --> 18:55.600
Let's finish this!

18:55.600 --> 18:57.150
Bear Water Magic!

18:59.390 --> 19:01.040
Hunting complete!

19:03.140 --> 19:04.530
There we go.

19:05.820 --> 19:07.550
You're good to go.

19:07.550 --> 19:09.430
Thank you for everything!

19:09.430 --> 19:11.250
We don't know how to thank you!

19:11.250 --> 19:14.090
No, I just happened to pass by.

19:14.990 --> 19:16.670
Thank you, Miss Bear.

19:18.700 --> 19:20.810
Good job holding back the tears.

19:22.090 --> 19:26.650
You really are dressed as a bear, 
just like the rumors.

19:26.650 --> 19:30.270
Rumors? Do you know me?

19:30.270 --> 19:31.730
Yes, there are many rumors.

19:32.120 --> 19:38.650
There's a strong girl dressed as a bear 
in Crimonia that even runs a business.

19:39.070 --> 19:41.530
You're famous in merchant circles.

19:41.990 --> 19:44.840
Rumors about me have spread this far...

19:45.280 --> 19:47.860
Wait, you're a merchant?!

19:47.860 --> 19:48.580
Yes.

19:48.580 --> 19:53.900
Well, we closed down our shop in Sheelin 
and want to try again in another city.

19:56.940 --> 19:58.260
Miss Yuna!

19:58.260 --> 20:00.740
Yuna Sis! Are you okay?!

20:13.340 --> 20:15.920
So, this is Sheelin.

20:15.920 --> 20:20.190
It doesn't look that different from Crimonia.
 I mean that in a good way.

20:21.980 --> 20:23.370
They're staring at us.

20:23.370 --> 20:24.820
They are.

20:25.200 --> 20:26.660
Definitely staring.

20:26.660 --> 20:28.270
They're all staring.

20:31.270 --> 20:35.210
Oh, they're probably staring 
because Cliff and Noa are nobles.

20:35.210 --> 20:38.170
No! They're all staring at you!

20:38.940 --> 20:41.470
I know. I know!

20:41.470 --> 20:44.880
Even so, I don't want to accept that reality.

20:46.590 --> 20:48.430
Yuna Sis...

20:48.430 --> 20:50.640
Please do not worry!

20:50.640 --> 20:53.690
They are all staring because 
of how adorable you look!

20:53.690 --> 20:58.110
<i>Stop, Noa! You're making me feel much worse!</i>

21:01.510 --> 21:04.860
<i>Huh? There are suddenly fewer people...</i>

21:06.810 --> 21:07.570
Hey, Cliff...

21:07.570 --> 21:09.340
We've arrived.

21:09.340 --> 21:12.160
This is Misa's house. The Farrengram house!

21:13.280 --> 21:16.290
We have been waiting for you.

21:16.750 --> 21:18.580
It has been a while, Meishun.

21:19.030 --> 21:21.900
I am glad to see you 
in good health, Lord Cliff.

21:21.900 --> 21:24.300
You've grown so much Lady Noir.

21:24.300 --> 21:26.950
Yes, I have gotten taller!

21:27.420 --> 21:29.780
You must be Lady Yuna and Lady Fina?

21:29.780 --> 21:34.550
I've heard from Lady Misa-na and 
Lord Gran that you are their savior.

21:34.550 --> 21:35.980
They're exaggerating.

21:35.980 --> 21:38.190
N-No, I didn't do anything!

21:38.730 --> 21:41.760
Lady Misa-na has been waiting for you.

21:41.760 --> 21:43.400
I will lead you to her.

21:44.590 --> 21:45.730
Misa!

21:47.890 --> 21:53.660
Welcome, Sister Noa! Fina! Sister Yuna!

21:55.890 --> 21:57.500
<i>What a bright smile.</i>

21:57.500 --> 21:58.170
<i>Yeah.</i>

21:59.340 --> 22:03.500
<i>I'm glad I didn't turn down 
the invitation to her birthday party.</i>

23:35.350 --> 23:40.020
<b>Bear, Getting Motivated</b>

23:35.390 --> 23:40.020
<b>Next Episode</b>

23:35.630 --> 23:37.030
Bear...
